{"id": "126639", "name": "וריאציית פרמטרים – פתרון כללי בביטוי אחד, פתרונות הומוגניים x^a ו-x^(a+1)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "f", "params": ["x"], "body": "x*%e^(a1*x)"}, {"name": "g", "params": ["x"], "body": "%e^(a1*x)"}, {"name": "y1", "params": ["x"], "body": "x^a2"}, {"name": "y2", "params": ["x"], "body": "f(x)/g(x)*y1(x)"}, {"name": "w", "params": ["t"], "body": "at(ev(y1(x)*diff(y2(x),x)-y2(x)*diff(y1(x),x),simp,expand),x=t)"}, {"name": "k1", "params": ["x"], "body": "ev(integrate(-f(x),x),simp,expand)"}, {"name": "k2", "params": ["x"], "body": "ev(integrate(g(x),x),simp,expand)"}, {"name": "z", "params": ["x"], "body": "y1(x)*k1(x)+y2(x)*k2(x)"}], "questiontext": "<p> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">מצאו את הפתרון הכללי של המשוואה</p>\n<p> \\[ {{CT:0}}={{CT:1}} \\] </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">בתחום x&gt;0.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">השתמשו ב c1 ו- c2 לציין הקבועים בתשובתכם.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\\[y(x)\\] = [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">רמז: למשוואה ההומוגנית המתאימה יש פתרון מן הצורה \\[ y=x^a \\].</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p> </p>\n<p> </p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "C1:c1;\nC2:c2;\nA:c1;\nB:c2;\nstdivcheck:ev(diff(ans1,x,2)+p*diff(ans1,x)+p2*ans1,simp);\nu1:ev(diff(ans1,c1),simp);\nu2:ev(diff(ans1,c2),simp);\nstdivcheck2:ev(diff(c1*u1+c2*u2,x,2)+p*diff(c1*u1+c2*u2,x)+p2*(c1*u1+c2*u2),simp);\nindep:ev(u1*diff(u2,x)-diff(u1,x)*u2,simp);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "stdivcheck", "tans": "g1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "indep", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.3, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"> התשובה שנתת אומנם פותרת את המשוואה, אך זה לא הפתרון הכללי.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": "<p style=\"direction: rtl;\">תשובה נכונה, כל הכבוד!</p>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "stdivcheck", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "Result-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "indep", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.2, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-T", "feedback": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span>התשובה שנתת היא פתרון למשוואה ההומוגנית, אבל גם במקרה זה - זה לא פתרון כללי!</span></p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.4, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-F", "feedback": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">התשובה שנתת היא פתרון כללי למשוואה ההומוגנית, אבל לא למשוואה הנתונה!</p>"}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "stdivcheck2", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-5-T", "feedback": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">הפתרון הכללי למשוואה ההומוגנית נכון, אך הפתרון הפרטי למשוואה שגוי.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-5-F", "feedback": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span>התשובה שנתת לא פותרת את המשוואה, וגם לא את המשוואה ההומוגנית המתאימה</span></p>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["a1", "a2", "g1", "p", "p2", "q", "ta"], "nvariants": 50}